==Tamil==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ta|வேணாம்||Spoken Tamil}}

===Etymology===
{{inflection of|ta|வேண்டு||neg|t=to be [[wanted]]|cap=1}}.<ref>{{R:TAL}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{ta-IPA}}

===Verb===
{{head|ta|verb form}}

# {{n-g|A [[modal verb]] meaning 'will not be [[needed]] or [[required]]' or 'will not be [[wanted]] or [[desired]]'.}}
#: {{parasyn|ta|தேவையில்லை<t:is not needed>}}
#: {{ux|ta|[[எனக்கு]] [[அது]] '''வேண்டாம்'''.|I '''don't want''' that.}}
#: {{ux|ta|[[அவனுக்கு]] [[இப்போது]] [[சாப்பாடு]] '''வேண்டாம்'''.|He '''doesn't need''' food right now.}}
# {{sid|ta|auxiliary}} {{lb|ta|modal|_|auxiliary}} [[should]] not, [[must]] not, does not [[have to]]
#: {{parasyn|ta|கூடாது<t:should not>}}
#: {{ux|ta|[[நீ]] [[அதை]] [[செய்ய]] '''வேண்டாம்'''.|You '''do not have to''' do that.}}
#: {{ux|ta|[[அவள்]] [[இன்றைக்கு]] [[நடக்க]] '''வேண்டாம்'''.|She '''shouldn't'''/'''mustn't''' walk today.}}

====Usage notes====
* Common to all [[gender]]s, [[number]]s and [[person]]s.

====Antonyms====
* {{l|ta|வேண்டும்}}

